    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 20(4)(b) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on being satisfied that the administration of theaffairs of the South Eastern University, Sri Lanka have been restored to normal conditions, do by this Order, revoke witheffect from August 9, 2018, the Order made under the aforesaid Act, and published in the Government GazetteExtrarodinay No. 2076/13 of June 19, 2018 appointing Professor Uma Coomaraswamy as the Competent Authority inlieu of the Vice-Chancellor of the South Eastern University, Sri Lanka.",
